**Theorem 341.2 (repo-derived).** Under these hypotheses, every genuine
owner eta whose two axes are Z,U and whose
transverse pair is either {V,C} or {V,D} satisfies

    theta_Z(eta)+theta_U(eta)>pi.                  (341.3)

